{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11101370","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11101370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110137001:1":{"text":"荒涼の砂漠は恐ろしい所だね……ソヨゴ学会の一員になってからというもの、こんな危険な場所に来たのは初めてだ……","source_cn":"荒角沙漠好可怕！加入冬青学会后，我还从没来过这么危险的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABED7BD06A32B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110137002:1":{"text":"こんな研究、参加しなきゃよかった。先輩の話を鵜呑みにしたばかりに……","source_cn":"我已经后悔听了前辈的鬼话，加入这个课题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417D3CBDE1622CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110137003:1":{"text":"や、やばい！今の聞こえたかな？先輩にぶたれる……！","source_cn":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6603091533E3EE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110137003":{"text":"や、やばい！今の聞こえたかな？先輩にぶたれる……！","source_cn":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6603091533E3EE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110137004:1":{"text":"え？先輩ー？先輩どこですかー！？一人にしないでくださいよお！","source_cn":"诶？前辈——！前辈你在哪里！为什么留下我一个人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CC06887744BC17D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110137005:1":{"text":"砂漠は迷いやすいって聞いてたけど……ま、まさか先輩が迷子に！？","source_cn":"来之前我就听说，这片沙漠特别容易迷路！难道、难道前辈迷路了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB439283D5409FFE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110137006:1":{"text":"大変だ！先輩を探しに行かないと！えっと……もうクモは出てこないよね？","source_cn":"不行，我要去找前辈！这片沙漠里应该没有别的蜘蛛了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32DBD3640B8D9B35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110137007:1":{"text":"多分な、他の獣はどうか知らないが。","source_cn":"蜘蛛有可能，别的野兽也不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2210C56561FE15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110137008:1":{"text":"うぅ……まだ足がガクガクしてる。意外に思うかもしれないけど、僕はクモが一番怖くて……","source_cn":"呃！腿软了！诸位可能看不出来，不过我其实最怕蜘蛛了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F895A4C2131C182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110137008":{"text":"うぅ……まだ足がガクガクしてる。意外に思うかもしれないけど、僕はクモが一番怖くて……","source_cn":"呃！腿软了！诸位可能看不出来，不过我其实最怕蜘蛛了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F895A4C2131C182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":""